Python mein different types ke operators use hota hein 

1. Arithmetic Operators (Math ke liye)

Ye calculations karte hain:

Operator	USE	            Example
+	        Addition	        a + b
-	        Subtraction	        a - b
*	        Multiplication	    a * b
/	        Division	        a / b
%	        Remainder	        a % b
//	        Floor Division	    a // b
**	        Power	            a ** b

EXAMPLE:-
a = 10 #ya aik variable ha jis me hamna a or b ki value store kra di ha
b = 3

print(a + b)
print(a - b)
print(a * b)
print(a / b)
print(a % b)
print(a // b)
print(a ** b)

2. Comparison Operators (Compare karne ke liye)
Operator	Meaning
==	         Equal
!=	         Not Equal
>	         Greater than
<	         Less than
>=	         Greater or Equal
<=	         Less or Equal

EXAMPLE:-
x = 10 #ya aik variable ha jis me hamna a or b ki value store kra di ha
y = 5

print(x == y)
print(x != y)
print(x > y)
print(x < y)
print(x >= y)
print(x <= y)

3. Logical Operators (Conditions ke liye)
Operator	  Meaning
and	          Dono conditions true hon
or	          Ek condition true ho
not	          Opposite result

EXAMPLE:-
age = 20 #ya aik variable ha jis me hamna a or b ki value store kra di ha

print(age > 18 and age < 30)
print(age < 18 or age > 50)
print(not(age > 18))

4. Assignment Operators (Value assign karne ke liye)
Operator	 Example
=	          x = 5
+=	          x += 2
-=	          x -= 2
*=	          x *= 2
/=	          x /= 2
EXAMPLE:-
x = 10

x += 5
print(x)

x -= 3
print(x)
#or baki bhi isi tara honga

5. Identity Operators
Operator	   Meaning
is	          Same object check
is not	      Different object check

EXAMPLE:-
a = [1,2,3]
b = a

print(a is b)  #ab ya check kra ga ka a ka variable ka andar b ki value ha
print(a is not b) #ab ya check kra ga or dekha ga kahi a ka nadr b ki value to nhi ha

6. Membership Operators
Operator	       Meaning
in	              Present hai ya nahi
not in	          Present nahi hai

EXAMPLE:-
name = "Ali"

print("A" in name)  #ab ya check kra ga ka uper jo variable ka nadar value ha us me A ha ya nhi
print("z" not in name)  #ab ya check kra ga ka khi uper variable me z to nhi ha

7. Bitwise Operators
Operator	    USE
&	            AND
`	            `
^	            XOR
~	            NOT
<<	        Left shift
>>	        Right shift

EXAMPLE:-
a = 5
b = 3

print(a & b)
print(a | b)
print(a ^ b)
